{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-13_beg","storyGroup":"main_12","storySort":134,"storyDependence":"main_12_level_main_12-13_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"12-15","storyName":"千疮百孔","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"经历了漫长岁月的变形者集群向年轻的女妖之主敞开了心扉。随着酒店的一场大火，诺伯特区的真正的乱局才终于开始。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_12-13_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_12-13","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"next":19,"characters":["Logos","“伊比利亚人”","变形者集群","阿米娅","戴菲恩","“灰礼帽”","伊内丝","考伯特","明椒","曼弗雷德"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"dialog","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"character","fadetime":"0","id":6},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_bg_ibtownn.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":11,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"这次是伊比利亚。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"耐心些，女妖，我在这里的日子最难忘。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"我以为你不会喜欢那里。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"在那场灾难发生之前，我确实不喜欢伊比利亚。那些夸夸其谈和自以为是让我腻烦透了。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"他们不懂得畏惧。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"那么，那场灾难让你满足了吗？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我不是老红眼病那样的心理变态，灾难本身也没什么出奇，这片大地何时缺少过灾难？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"但那些生物让我着迷。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"我只是听说过一些传闻，说实话，那些东西让我十分不安。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"它们与我们过于迥异。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"那你认为我与你迥异吗，女妖？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"你应该知道，无论是哪种样子，都不是真正的我。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"源石在所有人的身上都留下了无可辩驳的烙印，它让你们以现有的样子在世间行走。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"可它唯独忘记了变形者。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"唯独我们仍然保存了最初生时的样子。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"你会为你的纯洁自豪吗？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"不，不，当这个世界都已变了样子，纯洁又还有什么意义？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我只能追赶它带来的变化，我只能追赶你们。追赶你们所创造的一切。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我用尽了各种办法，我在伊比利亚发现了一个荒废的镇子，我住了进去。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我们住了进去。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我们让那座镇子重新运行起来，工作，交流，商业，交通......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"两百个我组成了一个小镇。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"我不知道你至今都没有陷入疯狂，是你的幸运还是不幸。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"哈，谁知道呢。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"总之，我在那里度过了印象深刻的一段时光，有那么多的事情要处理，我每天沉溺其中。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"这给我带来了一种错觉，我们过得有意义。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"但是，疲乏最终还是到来了，专注于琐事很有趣，但是就算把它们全部加起来，依然无法让我找到答案。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"直到我发现了它们，我听有的人称呼那些东西为“海嗣”。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"我观察了它们很久。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"它们让你想到了自己。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"不，论统一，我们超过了海嗣和它们的那些大群。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"无论分化为多少形貌，我们始终是统一的，而海嗣，它们只能选择投入大群。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"但是，你知道吗，我羡慕它们。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"它们只需要遵循本能就够了。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"寻找食物，寻找养分，繁衍，进化。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"或许，你刚刚所说的，“纯洁”这个词，应该放在它们身上。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"而我，我留在原地，看着这一切，看着那些多姿多彩的小生物把一片海草同化为它们的一员。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"它们什么都不想，它们做自己该做的事。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"而我们呢，我们的本能是什么？我们又该做什么？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"女妖，你能给我们什么建议？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"你在笑吗？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"抱歉，变形者，我并非在嘲笑你。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"那位可称最古老的王庭之主的变形者阁下，只是在寻找他生活的意义。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"这很重要，这当然很重要，我只是没想过，站在我面前的，原来是个彷徨的哲学家。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"你猜，我们在维多利亚的大学当了几年哲学教授？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"对于你们而言，寻找意义是简单的，除去那极少部分存在，生命总可称得上短暂。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"为自己寻找到一个目标，用以填满这些时光没那么难。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“伊比利亚人”","text":"但我们不行。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"character","fadetime":"0","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_bg_25_mini02_victoria_street_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"无论是你的提议，还是特雷西斯的未来，我们都没什么兴趣。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"对于我们而言，都是打发时间罢了。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"我们为什么要对这些转瞬即逝的东西抱有感情呢？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"我们几乎穷尽了一切可能，我们也几乎穷尽了一切乐趣。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"我开始可怜你了，变形者。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"你发现了我们只是个喊着什么都没劲透了的老家伙。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"知道这个秘密的人可不多。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"我的几个朋友教过我一种愚蠢的游戏......","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_650_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"不，还是算了。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_650_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"说说吧，女妖，我们比你猜的要有兴趣。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"不过，或许得等等了，有个麻烦的工作找上门了。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_426_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"变形者集群","text":"不是在这里，但我们恐怕还是得分点心。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_426_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"character","fadetime":"0","id":116},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_bg_37_g6_hotellobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":119,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"没有......是什么意思？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"没有就是没有，该死的！","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"通讯站不在那里，那里什么也没有，有人抢先了！","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"是那些深池的部队吗？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"恐怕还要早得多。根据灰尘的厚度判断，诺伯特区刚驶离伦蒂尼姆的时候，就有人盯上那里了。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_867_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“灰礼帽”","text":"那位赤铁近卫队的队长不会真的被我们骗过去的，他很快就会发现预计的通讯没有发出。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_867_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_867_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“灰礼帽”","text":"但最起码，我们又回到同一条起跑线了，大家重新有了挣奖金的机会。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_867_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"无论是服务于开斯特公爵的你，还是深池的鬼魂部队......","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"你们都以秘密潜入的方式进入这个地块，这就说明了，你们想维持诺伯特区表面上的现状。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"无法逼迫公爵们的主力部队行动起来，我们的计划就没办法真正实现。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"别再用这套说辞了，戴菲恩。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"只要你的那位公爵母亲知道你还在这里，她就会想办法来救你的，对吧。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_866_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"戴菲恩","text":"我不能保证......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_866_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"承认自己和母亲的关系不错没什么丢人的。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"154","text":"你有办法吗，伊内丝？"}},"values":[],"id":153},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":154,"end":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"很麻烦。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-9$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"160","text":"看来你能做到。"}},"values":[],"id":159},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":160,"end":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"......我真的很讨厌你这一点。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"不过，好吧，我会试着去做。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"我得找个高处，别抱太大希望。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"伊内丝小姐，你所说的办法需要多长时间？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"等到日出。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊内丝","text":"让推进之王和她的市民朋友们做好准备。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_4087_ines_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"各位，祝你们顺利，希望你们下次还能选择日落街酒店。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"我在这里度过了很美好的时光，我在这里认识了些很不错的人。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"诺伯特区是个生机勃勃的好地方，别让它就这么沦为回忆和废墟。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#21$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"老先生，我们会的。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"阴谋与纷争终会消弭。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"有一位......我十分十分想念的人和我说过......","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"也许有一天......这片大地上的每一个人，都能平静入梦。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_394_1-3$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":188},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":189},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"character","fadetime":"0","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"唉，真是折腾，这家酒店又乱了几分。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"不亲自打扫的人，总是不知道保持一点秩序有多不容易。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"珀茜瓦尔！珀茜瓦尔！","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"她又跑到哪里去了......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"好吧，就让我这个老家伙自己待一会儿吧。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"这位年迈的酒店经理找来了一张同样年迈的扶手椅，选了个舒服的姿势坐了进去。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"她......那个卡特斯女孩，就是魔王吗？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"追上这些变化越来越难了，就连我都要为此吃惊。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"变化......变化，也许我怠惰于这种变化了吧。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"变化毕竟不是前进。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"好了，也该告别这位老朋友了，说实话......我真的很喜欢这里。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"唉......考伯特该再坚持两个月的，谁能想到呢，两个月后，萨卡兹的军队进了城，一个魔族佬也能从清洁员变成酒店经理呢。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"我总是弄不懂这些。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"charslot","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"萨卡兹老人站起身来，巡视着酒店的大堂，这里的每一件物品都与他息息相关。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"那个叫伊内丝的卡普里尼说，战争不配用任何修饰。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_865_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"考伯特","text":"那么，就让我们还原它本来的面貌吧。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_865_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_lighter","volume":"0.6","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"在不知被多少政要贵族踏上过的精美编织地毯上，萨卡兹老人丢下一枚点燃的打火机。","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.1","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","loop":"false","channel":"a","volume":"0.3","delay":"0.5","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0.8","g":"0.3","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"text","text":"随即，火焰熊熊升起。","id":245},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":249},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_bg_37_g5_blockadewall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":256,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"这里......这些士兵，都被杀死了？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"是敌人吗？！如果我早些发现的话......","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"他们的家属会收到抚恤金，如果有家属的话。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"我们必须防备......","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"不用。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"你的那副表情......你早就知道？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"你......这也是你计划的一部分......","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"这是卡兹戴尔军事委员会的安排。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"雇佣兵，牺牲是在所难免的，我以为你的队长早就教过你这一点。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"你是个将军，他们是你的士兵！","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"是啊，我是个将军，这就是我的工作。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"无论是我们的敌人还是我们自己，需要做的事情就是把一个个生命投进这个名为战争的巨口中——","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"并祈祷它能吐出让我们称心如意的结果。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"这就是以我的立场能做的所有行为。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"你——","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"所以我会过来，我会过来注视着这一切。看过这里每一张年轻的苍白的脸庞。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"我必须牢记，这是我做出的决定。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"我不会说这是萨卡兹不得不付出的代价，雇佣兵。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"维多利亚人杀死了他们，但是是我让他们被维多利亚人杀死。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"为什么要这样做？","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"为了点燃火焰。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"点燃一场遍及这片大地的火焰。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"而我们......萨卡兹，唯有在这样一片纷争的大地上，才有可能找到自己的位置，找到自己生存的空间。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"雇佣兵，你必须学会熟悉它。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"熟悉它，憎恨它，最后接受它。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"因为这是唯一的办法。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"0.3","text":"","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"一团明亮的火焰猛然在封锁区中升起，老旧的大楼在熊熊燃烧。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4071_peper_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"明椒","text":"又是......火灾吗？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_4071_peper_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"不，那是第一簇火苗。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"雇佣兵，跟我来吧，我们需要回到飞空艇上。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_404_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"曼弗雷德","text":"客人们都已经入席了。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_404_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":326},{"type":"character","id":327},{"type":"image","id":328}],"characters":["Logos","“伊比利亚人”","变形者集群","阿米娅","戴菲恩","“灰礼帽”","伊内丝","考伯特","明椒","曼弗雷德"]}